{"name": "Yerba Buena", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/2f822c1a3ed8d13181cd458bdb0473e7.avif?t=1784712333\" width=\"1560\"/></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a surreal puzzle-platforming adventure as Barb, a young woman living as an NPC in an abandoned gameworld. Your beloved city of San Francisco is under threat from a sinister plot and it is up to you to save it with the help of a mysterious and powerful device: the Oscillator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/56ed18b35c1dcec54a665b11df9f7210.avif?t=1784712333\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/d2d9b4a0170204ab461cd6aa9dd4b7c3.poster.avif?t=1784712333\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/d2d9b4a0170204ab461cd6aa9dd4b7c3.webm?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/d2d9b4a0170204ab461cd6aa9dd4b7c3.mp4?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a ground-breaking \u201cCopy and Paste\u201d mechanic and manipulate the gameworld by applying the movement and physical traits of objects onto others. Give a table the bounce of a trampoline, send entire buildings across city blocks or turn solid walls into thin air!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/4eafe24b7a8bee4543c41f7f2fa7e5f5.avif?t=1784712333\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/5ad38750a74c792bb10d8192176f3a68.poster.avif?t=1784712333\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/5ad38750a74c792bb10d8192176f3a68.webm?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/5ad38750a74c792bb10d8192176f3a68.mp4?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into an original video game world set in 1970\u2019s San Francisco and save your city from greed and destruction! Use your Oscillator to solve ingenious puzzles, track down a dangerous gang of bikers with superpowers, and discover the origins of the mysterious glitch that threatens San Francisco.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/4b06c13de9f85a19c5427b85e93a98ee.avif?t=1784712333\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/2e5d82791eb9105c7c8e29cd4520f836.poster.avif?t=1784712333\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/2e5d82791eb9105c7c8e29cd4520f836.webm?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/2e5d82791eb9105c7c8e29cd4520f836.mp4?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Barb, a young woman struggling to find her way in 1970s San Francisco. Become the main character you were never meant to be with the help of your friends Russell, Wanda, Jorge, and some unlikely allies! </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Dive into a surreal 1970s gameworld and save San Francisco from a sinister threat. Play as Barb, and use the Oscillator to capture and reapply the physical traits of objects to solve mind-bending environmental platforming puzzles.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/f533108d4f7d6dd8d3ee9d4dac64d188a804ec33/header.jpg?t=1784712333", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["First-Person", "Puzzle Platformer", "Singleplayer", "Puzzle", "Physics", "Adventure"], "developers": "Mad About Pandas", "publishers": "Mad About Pandas", "release_date": "May 26, 2026", "price": "$24.99", "appid": "2330110", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "16 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ywdnRbpG-4Q", "first_seen": 1776297600.0, "review_rank": 830}